element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/Den_of_Vipers\" title=\"Den of Vipers\">Den of Vipers</a></b>, given by Lantern Stockpiles on Elite and Reaper\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Invoke_Lantern_Ritual\" title=\"Invoke Lantern Ritual\">Invoke Lantern Ritual</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Invoke_Lantern_Ritual\" title=\"Invoke Lantern Ritual\">Invoke Lantern Ritual</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 5<br /><b>Charges: </b>5 (5/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 5 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:5)</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This lantern has been special constructed to pull the denizens of this domain back from the mists.</i>\n<p>Equip and use the lantern within a ritual circle to empower it. A circle at max power will glow green. You can also use the lantern to cleanse a circle or pull a mist stalker out of its mist form.\n</p><p>Destroys itself when out of charges.<i></i>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817041725\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.097 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2461/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19337/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4203/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n152.54%  127.364     32 Template:IO\n100.00%   83.497      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   83.497      1 -total\n 96.84%   80.862      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 52.37%   43.727      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 51.30%   42.830      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 49.55%   41.372      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 48.40%   40.415      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.23%   16.055      3 Template:Popup\n 19.11%   15.956      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:113623-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817041725 and revision id 629785. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
